#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:5 d2b6919a36d14d7b918b941afe7d212c
msgid "CUAV PW-Link"
msgstr "CUAV PW-Link"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:10
#: 7f4addab1ce749dcb8bfcf54c52555fb
msgid ""
"CUAV PW-LINK is an ESP8266 based 2.4Ghz WIFI telemetry radio. It connects to"
" any ArduPilot telemetry port using +5V,gnd,TX and RX signals. Running at "
"the standard default parameters of 57.6 Kbaud and MAVLink2 telemetry "
"protocol, it connects via the standard Mission Planner/ QGC UDP port 14550 "
"over WIFI."
msgstr ""
"CUAV PW-LINK 是基于 ESP8266 的 2.4GHz WIFI 数传电台。它使用 +5V、GND、TX 和 RX 信号连接到任何 "
"ArduPilot 数传端口。以标准默认参数 57.6 Kbaud 和 MAVLink2 数传协议运行，通过标准 Mission Planner/QGC"
" UDP 端口 14550 经 WIFI 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:12
#: 24f2ff9982684092afad1b25210731b6
msgid "With its external antenna, range of 450 meters is typical."
msgstr "配备外置天线后，通信距离通常可达 450 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:17
#: 55912de7811245498e2aa02731e4eabe
msgid "Connecting to the Ground Station"
msgstr "连接地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:19
#: 1a3153fcb06741108adbc49cb672b1ad
msgid ""
"Open WIFI connection dialog on PC or Android Phone and select the "
"``CUAVWLINKxxxx`` SSID and connect using the password ``cuavwlink``. Once "
"connected use the UDP connection with port = 14550 (which is default) to "
"connect using Mission Planner. QGC should auto-detect and connect. The PW-"
"LINK default IP address is ``192.168.4.1``."
msgstr ""
"在 PC 或 Android 手机上打开 WIFI 连接对话框，选择 ``CUAVWLINKxxxx`` SSID，使用密码 ``cuavwlink``"
" 连接。连接后，使用端口 = 14550（默认）的 UDP 连接，通过 Mission Planner 连接。QGC 应自动检测并连接。PW-LINK "
"默认 IP 地址为 ``192.168.4.1``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:24
#: ea4b4bdfb0c34c5a8180d71e6bd34d93
msgid "MAVProxy"
msgstr "MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pwlink.rst:26
#: c17232924bcd41d9b68eaf3494c9fe7e
msgid ""
"The following command can be used to connect a MAVProxy ground station to "
"the vehicle."
msgstr "可使用以下命令将 MAVProxy 地面站连接到飞行器。"

